<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>TaskOrb - Boards and a live map for outreach, sales, and fieldwork</title>
  <meta name="description" content="TaskOrb pairs Kanban boards with a live map, so outreach, sales, and fieldwork stay organized by what's next and where it is.">
  <link rel="icon" href="/img/logo.png">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/landing.css">
</head>
<body class="landing">

  <nav class="landing-nav">
    <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="logo-chip"><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="TaskOrb" class="logo-img"></span></a>
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <a href="/login" class="btn ghost small">Log in</a>
      <a href="/register" class="btn small">Get started</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="landing-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <h1>Every lead, every task, exactly where it happened.</h1>
      <p class="lede">TaskOrb pairs Kanban boards with a live map, so outreach, sales, and fieldwork stay organized by what's next &mdash; and where it is.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/register" class="btn">Get started free</a>
        <a href="/login" class="btn ghost">Log in</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">No credit card. Set up your first board in under a minute.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="mock-board">
        <div class="mock-board-cols">
          <div class="mock-col">
            <div class="mock-col-title">To visit</div>
            <div class="mock-card">Maple St. block<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#E0459A;"></span></div>
            <div class="mock-card">Downtown route<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#3AA0E0;"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-col">
            <div class="mock-col-title">In progress</div>
            <div class="mock-card">Riverside follow-up<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#38B24A;"></span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-col">
            <div class="mock-col-title">Done</div>
            <div class="mock-card">Oak Ave contact<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#7B4FE0;"></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mock-map">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 300 220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M0 60 H300 M0 130 H300 M60 0 V220 M190 0 V220" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.35)" stroke-width="3"/>
          <path d="M0 95 H300" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.2)" stroke-width="10"/>
          <g class="mock-pin">
            <circle cx="90" cy="70" r="7" fill="#E0459A" stroke="#1B2A41" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          </g>
          <g class="mock-pin">
            <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="7" fill="#3AA0E0" stroke="#1B2A41" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          </g>
          <g class="mock-pin">
            <circle cx="230" cy="60" r="7" fill="#38B24A" stroke="#1B2A41" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          </g>
          <g class="mock-pin pulse">
            <circle class="ring" cx="210" cy="150" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#7B4FE0" stroke-width="2"/>
            <circle cx="210" cy="150" r="7" fill="#7B4FE0" stroke="#1B2A41" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          </g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="landing-band">
    <div class="band-copy">
      <h2>See your whole territory, not just a list.</h2>
      <p>Tap anywhere on the map to log a new card right where you're standing &mdash; a door you knocked on, a site visit, a delivery stop. Every pin links straight back to its card, with the address filled in automatically.</p>
      <p>Filter the map by board, list, or tag to see exactly the slice of work you care about, without losing the rest.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="band-visual map-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 420 260" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect width="420" height="260" rx="10" fill="#16233A"/>
        <path d="M0 90 H420 M0 190 H420 M90 0 V260 M270 0 V260 M340 0 V260" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.14)" stroke-width="3"/>
        <path d="M0 140 H420" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.08)" stroke-width="14"/>
        <circle cx="130" cy="80" r="9" fill="#E0459A" stroke="#0E1729" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="200" cy="170" r="9" fill="#3AA0E0" stroke="#0E1729" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="310" cy="70" r="9" fill="#38B24A" stroke="#0E1729" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="60" cy="200" r="9" fill="#7B4FE0" stroke="#0E1729" stroke-width="2"/>
        <circle cx="360" cy="200" r="9" fill="#B5533C" stroke="#0E1729" stroke-width="2"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="landing-band alt">
    <div class="band-copy">
      <h2>Boards that move with your team.</h2>
      <p>Drag cards between lists, tag them by priority or type, attach photos and notes, and assign teammates &mdash; the same board works for a Sunday outreach route, a sales pipeline, or a punch list.</p>
      <p>Give each board its own cover photo and start from a template, or build your lists from scratch.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="band-visual board-visual">
      <div class="mock-board-cols">
        <div class="mock-col">
          <div class="mock-col-title">Backlog</div>
          <div class="mock-card">Follow up call<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#3AA0E0;"></span></div>
          <div class="mock-card">Send proposal<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#B5533C;"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-col">
          <div class="mock-col-title">Active</div>
          <div class="mock-card">Site walkthrough<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#38B24A;"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-col">
          <div class="mock-col-title">Waiting</div>
          <div class="mock-card">Awaiting signature<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#E0459A;"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mock-col">
          <div class="mock-col-title">Closed</div>
          <div class="mock-card">Contract signed<span class="mock-tag" style="background:#7B4FE0;"></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="landing-notes">
    <div class="landing-note">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2.5l7.5 3.4v5.6c0 4.9-3.2 8.7-7.5 9.9-4.3-1.2-7.5-5-7.5-9.9V5.9L12 2.5z"/></svg>
      <h3>Roles that match your team</h3>
      <p>Owners, editors, and viewers on every board; admins manage the whole organization. Everyone sees only what they need to.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-note">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="3.6"/><path d="M4.5 20c0-4 3.4-6.8 7.5-6.8s7.5 2.8 7.5 6.8"/></svg>
      <h3>Tags that carry meaning</h3>
      <p>Color-code cards by priority, type, or outcome. Filter the dashboard, boards, and map by the same tags, everywhere at once.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="landing-note">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="9" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="5" rx="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="12" width="7" height="9" rx="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="16" width="7" height="5" rx="1.5"/></svg>
      <h3>A dashboard that adds it up</h3>
      <p>See totals by board and tag, a leaderboard of who's logged what, and export the whole thing to PDF or CSV whenever you need to report out.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="landing-steps">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="step-row">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <div class="step-text">
        <h3>Create a board or drop a pin</h3>
        <p>Start a board from a template, or open the map and tap the spot you're standing in &mdash; TaskOrb fills in the address and lets you assign it to a board on the spot.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-row">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <div class="step-text">
        <h3>Organize with lists and tags</h3>
        <p>Move cards through lists as work progresses, color-tag them for quick scanning, and attach photos, notes, or files as you go.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="step-row">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <div class="step-text">
        <h3>Track it from the dashboard</h3>
        <p>See what's been logged, who logged it, and export a report &mdash; without opening a spreadsheet.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="landing-cta">
    <h2>Set up your first board today.</h2>
    <p>Free to start. No credit card required.</p>
    <a href="/register" class="btn">Get started free</a>
  </section>

  <footer class="landing-footer">
    <span>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> TaskOrb</span>
    <div>
      <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a href="/register">Get started</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
